            "content": "High-Level Summary Technical Assistance Report\nInstitute for Capacity Development"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.167,
                0.178,
                0.832,
                0.214
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Macro frameworks technical assistance to the Central bank of Iraq: TA project report\nPrepared by Yurii Sholomytskyi, Mumtaz Hussain, Stephanie Medina Cas",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.112,
                0.232,
                0.861,
                0.286
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "The High-Level Summary Technical Assistance Report series provides high-level summaries of the assistance provided to IMF capacity development recipients, describing the high-level objectives, findings, and recommendations.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.112,
                0.305,
                0.886,
                0.451
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "ABSTRACT: The document outlines the development and implementation of a macroeconomic projection tool at the Central Bank of Iraq (CBI), emphasizing collaboration and the growth of the CBI team. In a complex economic landscape, effective policymaking relies on robust forecasting and analysis. With support from the International Monetary Fund's Capacity Development (ICD) team, CBI initiated a project to enhance these capabilities. The project followed established ICD practices, involving scoping missions, training, and ongoing collaboration. A key outcome was the Macroeconomic Foundations Tool (MFT), an Excel-based forecasting tool tailored to address Iraq's oil dependency and customize fiscal and monetary policies with nowcasting capabilities.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.122,
                0.507,
                0.482,
                0.525
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "JEL Classification Numbers: E60, E62, E17, E10",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.121,
                0.535,
                0.856,
                0.572
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Keywords: Macroeconomic Framework, Financial Programming and Policies, Forecasting and Policy Analysis, Macroeconomic Foundations Tool",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.112,
                0.669,
                0.882,
                0.76
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "The contents of this document constitute a high-level summary of technical advice provided by the staff of the International Monetary Fund (IMF) to the authorities of a member country or international agency (the \"CD recipient\") in response to their request for capacity development. Unless the CD recipient specifically objects within 30 business days of its transmittal, the IMF will publish this high-level summary on IMF.org (see Staff Operational Guidance on the Dissemination of Capacity Development Information).",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.321,
                0.792,
                0.674,
                0.884
            ],
            "angle": 0,
