    [
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.112,
                0.09,
                0.881,
                0.127
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "quality of national accounts. This data is crucial for economic models to increase accuracy of the analysis of the relationships between expenditure components of national accounts and the rest of the economy.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.111,
                0.142,
                0.88,
                0.233
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "The CBI team has made significant progress in the adoption of the tool, but team turnover remains a noteworthy challenge. In July 2023, the CBI core team experienced a substantial turnover, which had a temporary impact on the technical assistance action plan. However, the newly formed core team has shown remarkable progress in understanding the MFT, especially its forecasting functionalities, enabling them to begin developing alternative scenarios in the upcoming mission.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.113,
                0.293,
                0.564,
                0.318
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Summary of Recommendations"
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.112,
                0.342,
                0.432,
                0.361
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "A. Operationalization of the MFT"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.112,
                0.373,
                0.883,
                0.464
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Continued utilization of the tool is vital for institutionalizing the MFT. To empower the authorities in their policy decision-making processes, it is important for the core team to consistently engage with the tool for forecasting practices. This engagement should encompass presenting both baseline and shock scenarios to the management of the CBI, as well as revising macroeconomic reports within the CBI to align with the logic and capabilities of the MFT.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.113,
                0.488,
                0.434,
                0.506
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "B. Statistical data improvements"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.111,
                0.519,
                0.879,
                0.61
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Enhancing statistical data quality is a fundamental component of optimizing the MFT's effectiveness. This entails a proactive follow-up with the Central Statistics Organization (CSO) to retrieve the national accounts expenditure components in fixed prices, which are crucial for accurate economic modeling, as well as enhanced collection of information on a quarterly or monthly basis. It is important to cooperate with the METAC which has been delivering statistical TA to improve national accounts and other data.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.113,
                0.633,
                0.579,
                0.652
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "C. Cooperation with other economic institutions"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.112,
                0.664,
                0.875,
                0.737
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "To further bolster the effectiveness of the monetary policy, it is essential for the CBI to actively cooperate with other economic institutions, particularly the Ministry of Finance. By incorporating the most current and relevant data from the budget and medium-term plans, the core team can establish solid assumptions to build reflect realistic projections for economic growth, inflation, and other key indicators.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
            "bbox": [
                0.115,
                0.957,
                0.152,
                0.971
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "IMF"
        },
